# oracle: pair_style mliap model quadratic with descriptor ace: the ccs_single_element.yace descriptors of the LAMMPS example examples/mliap (Ta, 37 ACE projections) with constructed quadratic coefficients, on a displaced 3x3x3 bcc Ta cell, 10 NVE steps
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_ML-IAP, PKG_ML-SNAP and PKG_ML-PACE (the installed binary has no ML-PACE)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native: thermo 3.0e-14, atoms 3.5e-16.
# oracle-inputs: w277ma_Ta_quadratic.mliap.model
# oracle-examples: mliap/ccs_single_element.yace
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           metal
boundary        p p p
lattice         bcc 3.316
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 180.88
displace_atoms  all random 0.1 0.1 0.1 4928459
pair_style      mliap model quadratic w277ma_Ta_quadratic.mliap.model descriptor ace ccs_single_element.yace
pair_coeff      * * Ta
thermo_style    custom step pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
velocity        all create 300 4928459 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
timestep        0.0005
thermo          5
run             10
